#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/gain/ex3/ex3.rst:2
msgid "Example 3: An odd preview"
msgstr "例3：奇妙なプレビュー"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/gain/ex3/ex3.rst:7
msgid "Did TFOD make this recognition?"
msgstr "TFODはこの認識を行いましたか？"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/gain/ex3/ex3.rst:10
msgid ""
"How can this be? Answer: this image was not an ‘instant’ result. Exposure "
"was reduced very low, **after** TFOD had recognized the Duck."
msgstr ""
"これはどういうことですか？答え：この画像は「瞬時」の結果ではありません。露出は非常に低く設定され、 **after** TFODがアヒルを認識しました。"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/gain/ex3/ex3.rst:13
msgid ""
"The implementations of TensorFlow Lite (and Vuforia) are good at "
"**tracking** a currently-identified object (or image) through translation, "
"rotation, partial blockage, and even extreme changes in exposure."
msgstr ""
"TensorFlow Lite（および "
"Vuforia）の実装は、現在特定されているオブジェクト（または画像）を、翻訳、回転、部分的な遮蔽、さらには極端な露出の変化を通じて "
"**tracking** するのが得意です。"
